---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="py-32" id="proceso">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-headline text-4xl font-bold mb-8">
        Por qué <span class="text-primary italic">TecnoDespegue</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-lg mb-12">
        No somos solo desarrolladores; somos socios estratégicos en la evolución técnica de tu negocio.
      </p>
      
      <ul class="space-y-10">
        <li class="flex gap-6 group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary-container transition-all duration-300">
            <Icon name="bolt" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">
              Foco Técnico
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
              Hardware-level mindset aplicado al desarrollo web.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="flex gap-6 group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary-container transition-all duration-300">
            <Icon name="terminal" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">
              Código Limpio
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
              Documentación rigurosa y patrones de diseño modernos.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="flex gap-6 group">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-on-primary-container transition-all duration-300">
            <Icon name="forum" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface mb-1 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">
              Comunicación Transparente
            </h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">
              Acceso directo a los ingenieros, sin intermediarios.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-tr from-primary/10 via-secondary/5 to-transparent blur-2xl"></div>

      <div class="relative bg-surface-container-lowest border border-white/10 h-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-card shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 bg-surface-container-high border-b border-white/5">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/70"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/70"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/70"></span>
          <span class="ml-3 text-xs font-mono text-on-surface-variant">~/tecnodespegue · deploy.sh</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 font-mono text-[13px] leading-relaxed space-y-2 flex-1">
          <div class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-secondary">$</span>
            <span class="text-on-surface">pnpm test:all && pytest</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-on-surface-variant pl-5 space-y-1">
            <div><span class="text-primary">→</span> running vitest suite <span class="text-secondary">✓ 84 passed</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-primary">→</span> running python pytest <span class="text-secondary">✓ 53 passed</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-primary">→</span> building optimized images <span class="text-secondary">✓ 4.2s</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-primary">→</span> deploying node & python apis <span class="text-secondary">✓</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-primary">→</span> rolling update (0 downtime) <span class="text-secondary">✓</span></div>
            <div><span class="text-primary">→</span> system health check <span class="text-secondary">200 OK</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-3 pt-2">
            <span class="text-secondary">$</span>
            <span class="text-on-surface">monitor --since 30d</span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-3">
            <div class="bg-surface-container border border-white/5 rounded-chip p-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-1">uptime</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">99.94%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container border border-white/5 rounded-chip p-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-1">p95 latency</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">87ms</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container border border-white/5 rounded-chip p-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-1">error rate</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary">0.02%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container border border-white/5 rounded-chip p-3">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-on-surface-variant mb-1">deploys/mes</div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary">38</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex gap-3 pt-3">
            <span class="text-secondary">$</span>
            <span class="text-on-surface-variant animate-pulse">_</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="px-6 py-4 border-t border-white/5 bg-surface-container-low">
          <p class="text-xs text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Entregamos resultados medibles, no promesas vacías. Métricas reales sobre proyectos en producción.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
